# The programs skwir's Windows package carries (tools/package/windows.sh,
# ADR-074): skwir, the helpers that link no library the package would
# have to carry for them, the archive helper, libarchive linked in
# statically (tools/package/libarchive.sh, ADR-041), and the media helper,
# with GStreamer beside it (tools/package/gstreamer.py, ADR-076). Those
# that link another (Poppler, MuPDF, DjVuLibre) wait for their libraries;
# skwir says the engine is not installed. Their notices are
# tools/package/notices/windows.
skwir
skwir-pdf-worker
skwir-djvu-worker
skwir-model-worker
skwir-module-worker
skwir-archive-worker
skwir-media-worker
